  9695	For an explicitly **pre-close decision boundary at `t`**, decision features use closed observations through `t-1`. At the canonical close-of-candle boundary `as_of=t`, closed candle `t` may be evaluated; formulas retaining the one-bar lag are conservative design choices, not alternate PIT definitions. For `is_closed=False`, preview output is Q0/unconfirmed and no event is emitted.
