  1418	    """E10_Momentum on the frozen EngineBase contract (v4.0.0).
  1419
  1420	    ``compute(symbol, timeframe, as_of, context)``; consumed context keys:
  1421	      ``window`` / ``provider`` — closed-candle window (catalog surface)
  1422	      ``e10_params``            — §6 overrides (unknown keys rejected)
  1423	      ``trend_context``         — optional canonical E09 v4.0.0 projection
  1424	                                  (incompatible version ⇒ Q downgrade §5.2)
  1425	      ``volatility_context``    — optional canonical E04 v4.0.0 projection
  1426	    Emits one ``EvidenceEvent`` per §5.3 catalog event fired on the last
  1427	    closed candle, on ``evidence.E10.{condition_state}``. Context only:
  1428	    every emission carries ``direction = 0`` (NG1 — momentum is never a
  1429	    standalone mandate; the E02 precedent for context engines).
  1430	    """
